{
  "id": "fb-1984",
  "title": "1984",
  "sourceTitle": "1984",
  "kind": "book",
  "synopsis": "Oceania. The Ministry of Truth. Big Brother watches. You buy a diary on impulse. Today you write: down with Big Brother.",
  "releaseYear": 1949,
  "addedAt": "2026-02-28T00:00:00Z",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "tags": [
    "dystopia",
    "orwell",
    "thought"
  ],
  "rating": null,
  "loved": false,
  "nextStoryId": null,
  "startNodeId": "s1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Cream-laid pages. The pen scratches. The telescreen, you hope, can't see your hands.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Diary",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Write the line",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Write a safer line",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "You face it for morning exercise. You are, by your face, a citizen.",
      "sceneTitle": "Telescreen",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Smile",
          "consequence": "Performance.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay blank",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "A dark-haired colleague drops a note into your hand. I love you.",
      "sceneTitle": "Julia",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Trust",
          "consequence": "Heart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Distrust",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "A meadow outside the city. The first kiss.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Field",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be present",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "An attic room above an antique shop. A coral paperweight on the table.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mr. Charrington's Room",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Rent it",
          "consequence": "Heart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Decline",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "At work, you compress language. Each draft removes a word.",
      "sceneTitle": "Newspeak Drafting",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Note it",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pretend not to note",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "You drop a slip of paper, an entire person, into a memory hole.",
      "sceneTitle": "Memory Hole",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wonder if she existed",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Move on",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Your superior, in a high office, drops a hint. He believes, you decide, in the resistance.",
      "sceneTitle": "O'Brien",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Visit him",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stall",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "He hands you the book in a brown paper wrapper. You and Julia read it in the attic.",
      "sceneTitle": "Goldstein's Book",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Read it together",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hide it",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Mr. Charrington is, you discover later, not a kind old man.",
      "sceneTitle": "Antiques",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Suspect him",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Trust him",
          "consequence": "Naive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "Boots on the stairs. The paperweight breaks on the hearth.",
      "sceneTitle": "Arrest",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay still",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Resist",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "White light. No darkness. They know what you've written.",
      "sceneTitle": "Ministry of Love",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Refuse to name Julia",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Name her",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "Your worst fear. Cage. Rat.",
      "sceneTitle": "Room 101",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Endure",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Beg",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "You say it.",
      "sceneTitle": "Do it to Julia",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Mean it for a moment",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't mean it",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "You are released into Victory Square. You drink Victory Gin.",
      "sceneTitle": "Released",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Drink",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "She looks worn. She tells you she did it too. You agree quietly to never speak again.",
      "sceneTitle": "Julia, Met Again",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Walk away",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sit a moment",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "You play yourself. White always wins.",
      "sceneTitle": "Chess in the Cafe",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Move",
          "consequence": "Routine.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't move",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "Africa is, somehow, ours. You drink.",
      "sceneTitle": "Telescreen Bulletin",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Cheer",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be still",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "You hum, briefly, the old children's rhyme.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Old Tune",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hum it",
          "consequence": "Defiance.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stop",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "His face on the screen. You realize, somewhere, you love him.",
      "sceneTitle": "Big Brother",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Notice it",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Refuse it",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "You think, briefly, of buying paper again.",
      "sceneTitle": "Pencil and Diary",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Don't",
          "consequence": "Survive.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_compliant"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_paper"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_meadow"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_compliant",
      "text": "You die some years later, unnoticed, with the right songs on your lips. Whatever you thought before is, finally, gone.",
      "sceneTitle": "Loved Big Brother",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Loved Big Brother"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_paper",
      "text": "You buy paper. You write. You bury it. Two centuries later a scholar finds the box and asks who you were.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Second Diary",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Second Diary"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_meadow",
      "text": "On your worst nights you remember the meadow. The first kiss. The single hour you were, in fact, a free person. You decide the hour was worth the rest. You don't tell anyone.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Meadow",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Meadow"
    }
  ]
}
